{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OH NO!<br>Looks like you have had an accident in the lab which has resulted in you being only a few inches tall!<br>Let's hope nobody will take advantage of your current situation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Tiny Treats!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vore-themed first-person action stealth game!<br>Run and duck from cover to cover as you try to find all the parts required to become regular-sized again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104420/extras/0e80adfefe75dc946b2132ab10e27fcf.webp?t=1768585997\" width=320 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;First-person stealth-focused gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;8 playable levels, including an interactive tutorial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;Many items with many uses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;Metroidvania-style progression system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;Secrets and collectables to find</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104420/extras/719f0be72f5a876ef81bd3ffd8125322.webp?t=1768585997\" width=320 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many varied levels to explore from your tiny point of view in a non-linear fashion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore laboratories, apartments and ventilation ducts in your search for the pieces of the teleportation device, all while trying your best to not be found by their inhabitants... or else...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104420/extras/286acc6829669673542c5c3d7179d9e1.webp?t=1768585997\" width=320 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many vore and size-focused scenes ranging from oral vore to unbirth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rude preds and friendly ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something to enjoy for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Educated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104420/d858d8ef28c910d22f2942fda1e5ad5e9d58db9e.jpg"},{"name":"Lazy Days","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104420/e954ca2b215b7c5ec7e875d230ceab49607f7839.jpg"},{"name":"Cube Gamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104420/775709d5fce84926dad07743979e5f2fad62db8c.jpg"},{"name":"Bending Iron","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104420/d48307d872b4cc47628dd5dbc70906b4595b1fc9.jpg"},{"name":"Sleepy Lady","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104420/8d3ccfdf3e20109288e7552136b43f25e84bec82.jpg"},{"name":"Gamer Girl GF","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104420/aab167a62aa48c898f880effaf8d6865e99ff1eb.jpg"},{"name":"The Empress","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104420/4db051b750661669747fe446323aff93dabbbf34.jpg"},{"name":"Is This A Technology Robot?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104420/777b8e7c67a2291264244fdee335d11f4e1074e4.jpg"},{"name":"Get In The Mech, Nikita ! ! !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104420/44e4d862c9c3089842bc672d691463547e265cd1.jpg"},{"name":"Fin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104420/527c9b4a29079de10cfa20662deab87c83f4c4e2.jpg"}],"total":28},"backgro